---
import SlideHeader from '../_components/SlideHeader.astro';
---

<section class="deck-slide justify-between relative overflow-hidden" data-slide-index="13">
  <div class="m3-glow-green"></div>

  <SlideHeader category="Pilier 05" topic="SCHEDULE : Maîtrise du Temps & Time-Blocking" />

  <div class="my-auto max-w-5xl w-full relative z-10">
    <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3">
      <div>
        <span class="text-xs font-bold text-[#8AB4F8] tracking-wider uppercase bg-[#8AB4F8]/10 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md border border-[#8AB4F8]/30">
          Google Calendar vs Google Tasks
        </span>
        <h2 class="title-h1 text-white mt-1">
          « Le Calendrier gère le QUAND, la Tâche gère le QUOI. »
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div class="hidden sm:block">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold text-[#81C784] bg-[#81C784]/10 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full border border-[#81C784]/30">
          Méthode : Time-Blocking Pro
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Calendar View & Principles Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-3.5 my-2">
      <!-- Weekly Time-Blocking Mockup (7 cols) -->
      <div class="md:col-span-7 card-m3 bg-surface-container p-3 border-white/10">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-1.5 mb-2 border-b border-white/10 text-xs">
          <span class="font-bold text-white">📅 Semaine Type Optimisée</span>
          <span class="text-[10px] text-white/40">Lun – Mer</span>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-2 text-[10px]">
          <!-- Day 1 -->
          <div class="space-y-1.5">
            <div class="font-bold text-center text-white/70 py-0.5 bg-surface-container-high rounded">Lundi</div>
            <div class="p-1.5 rounded-lg bg-[#8AB4F8]/15 border border-[#8AB4F8]/30 text-[#8AB4F8] font-medium">
              09:00 - 11:30<br />
              <strong>Deep Work : Analyse</strong>
            </div>
            <div class="p-1.5 rounded-lg bg-[#FDD663]/15 border border-[#FDD663]/30 text-[#FDD663] font-medium">
              14:00 - 15:00<br />
              <strong>Sync Équipe 7.77</strong>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Day 2 -->
          <div class="space-y-1.5">
            <div class="font-bold text-center text-white/70 py-0.5 bg-surface-container-high rounded">Mardi</div>
            <div class="p-1.5 rounded-lg bg-[#81C784]/15 border border-[#81C784]/30 text-[#81C784] font-medium">
              09:00 - 12:00<br />
              <strong>Atelier Pratique</strong>
            </div>
            <div class="p-1.5 rounded-lg bg-purple-500/15 border border-purple-500/30 text-purple-300 font-medium">
              16:00 - 17:00<br />
              <strong>Traitement Inbox</strong>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Day 3 -->
          <div class="space-y-1.5">
            <div class="font-bold text-center text-white/70 py-0.5 bg-surface-container-high rounded">Mercredi</div>
            <div class="p-1.5 rounded-lg bg-[#8AB4F8]/15 border border-[#8AB4F8]/30 text-[#8AB4F8] font-medium">
              09:00 - 11:30<br />
              <strong>Deep Work : Code</strong>
            </div>
            <div class="p-1.5 rounded-lg bg-[#81C784]/15 border border-[#81C784]/30 text-[#81C784] font-medium">
              15:00 - 16:00<br />
              <strong>Revue des Livrables</strong>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Principles Card (5 cols) -->
      <div class="md:col-span-5 flex flex-col justify-between space-y-2">
        <div class="card-m3 p-2.5 bg-surface-container border-white/10">
          <h4 class="font-bold text-xs text-[#8AB4F8] uppercase tracking-wide mb-1">
            1. Bloquez vos plages de Deep Work
          </h4>
          <p class="text-[11px] text-white/70 leading-relaxed">
            Si une tâche importante n'est pas bloquée dans votre calendrier, les imprévus rempliront votre temps à votre place.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card-m3 p-2.5 bg-surface-container border-white/10">
          <h4 class="font-bold text-xs text-[#81C784] uppercase tracking-wide mb-1">
            2. Regroupez les communications (Batching)
          </h4>
          <p class="text-[11px] text-white/70 leading-relaxed">
            Ne traitez pas vos messages toute la journée. Définissez 2 créneaux de 30 minutes dédiés pour préserver votre flux mental.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card-m3 p-2.5 bg-surface-container border-white/10">
          <h4 class="font-bold text-xs text-[#FDD663] uppercase tracking-wide mb-1">
            3. Google Tasks pour l'action immédiate
          </h4>
          <p class="text-[11px] text-white/70 leading-relaxed">
            Glissez un email directement dans Google Tasks pour créer un rappel sans encombrer votre boîte de réception.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-white/50 pt-3 border-t border-white/10 relative z-10">
    <span>Votre agenda doit refléter vos vraies priorités, pas celles des autres</span>
    <button type="button" class="btn-m3 btn-m3-yellow text-xs px-4 py-2 cursor-pointer" data-deck-next>
      <span>PILIER 6 : AUTOMATISATION DES TÂCHES →</span>
    </button>
  </div>
</section>
